CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'acpi_gbl_FADT.header.revision >= FADT2_REVISION_ID'
#128: FILE: arch/x86/kernel/apic/x2apic_phys.c:25:
